<section class="chapter" id="babi1">

<h2>Babi na 1 — Haɗuwar Farko</h2>

<p>
Khalid saurayi ne mai nutsuwa wanda yake son rayuwa cikin sauƙi.
Bai taɓa tunanin cewa wata rana mutum ɗaya zai iya canza yadda yake
kallon duniya ba.
</p>

<p>
Wata rana yana tafiya sai idanunsa suka hango wata yarinya mai suna
Fatima. Akwai wani abu a fuskarta da ya sa ya kasa kawar da idanunsa
daga gare ta.
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta ɗaga ido. Idanunsu suka haɗu na ɗan lokaci. Sai ta yi
murmushi sannan ta juya.
</p>

<p>
A wannan ranar Khalid ya koma gida amma tunaninsa ya kasa komawa
tare da shi. Fuskar Fatima ta zauna a zuciyarsa.
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Ban san sunanta ba, amma zuciyata ta riga ta san cewa akwai wani abu
na musamman a tare da ita.”
</div>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi2">

<h2>Babi na 2 — Sunan da Zuciya Ta Zaɓa</h2>

<p>
Bayan kwanaki, Khalid da Fatima suka fara yin magana a hankali.
Da farko maganganunsu sun kasance na gaisuwa ne kawai.
</p>

<p>
Amma kullum suna ƙara samun abin tattaunawa. Khalid ya gano cewa
Fatima mutum ce mai sauƙin kai, tausayi da kyakkyawar zuciya.
</p>

<p>
Wata rana Fatima ta tambaye shi:
“Me yasa kullum kake murmushi idan ka gan ni?”
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya yi murmushi ya ce:
“Saboda ganinki yana sa ranar da nake ciki ta zama mafi kyau.”
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Soyayya ba ta fara ne da kalmar ina sonki; wani lokaci tana fara ne
da murmushi guda da zuciya ta kasa mantawa.”
</div>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi3">

<h2>Babi na 3 — Sirrin Zuciya</h2>

<p>
Khalid ya fara gane cewa Fatima ta zama wani muhimmin ɓangare na
rayuwarsa.
</p>

<p>
Idan bai ji muryarta ba, ranar tana masa tsawo.
</p>

<p>
Fatima ma ta fara jin haka, amma tsoron abin da zai iya faruwa ya sa
ta ɓoye abin da ke zuciyarta.
</p>

<p>
Wata rana Khalid ya tambaye ta:
“Fatima, me kike tunani idan muna tare?”
</p>

<p>
Ta yi murmushi ta ce:
“Ba komai.”
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya ce:
“Idan ba komai ba ne, me yasa idan na tafi kike kallona har sai na ɓace?”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta kasa amsawa.
</p>

<p>
Shiru ya zama amsar da ta fi kowace magana bayyana abin da ke zuciyarta.
</p>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi4">

<h2>Babi na 4 — Kalmar Soyayya</h2>

<p>
Wata maraice Khalid ya yanke shawarar cewa ba zai sake ɓoye abin da ke
zuciyarsa ba.
</p>

<p>
Ya ce wa Fatima:
“Na daɗe ina son in faɗa miki wani abu.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta ce:
“Me kake son faɗa?”
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya ce:
“Na kamu da sonki. Ba don kyawunki kawai ba, amma saboda irin
zuciyar da kike da ita.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta yi shiru. Idanunta suka cika da hawaye.
</p>

<p>
Daga baya ta ce:
“Ni ma na daɗe ina jin haka.”
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Zuciyata ta zaɓe ki tun kafin bakina ya iya furta sunanki da kalmar
soyayya.”
</div>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi5">

<h2>Babi na 5 — Jarabawar Soyayya</h2>

<p>
Rayuwa ba ta kasance kullum cikin farin ciki ba. Bayan wani lokaci,
wasu matsaloli suka fara bayyana.
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya fara samun aiki mai yawa, kuma lokaci ya yi ƙaranci.
Fatima ta fara tunanin cewa watakila Khalid yana canza mata.
</p>

<p>
Saƙonnin da a da suke zuwa kullum suka ragu. Wannan ya sa zuciyar
Fatima ta fara cike da shakku.
</p>

<p>
Wata rana ta ce masa:
“Khalid, shin har yanzu kana sona?”
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya amsa:
“Ina sonki fiye da yadda zan iya bayyanawa. Abin da ya canza shi ne
lokacin da nake samu, ba soyayyata ba.”
</p>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi6">

<h2>Babi na 6 — Kewar Juna</h2>

<p>
Wani lokaci Khalid ya yi tafiya saboda wani muhimmin al'amari.
Ranar farko Fatima ta yi ƙoƙarin yin haƙuri.
</p>

<p>
Amma da dare, ta fahimci cewa kewar mutum na iya zama abu mai nauyi.
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Khalid, nayi kewarka. Ina fatan ka dawo lafiya. Ko da nesa ta raba
mu, zuciyata tana nan tare da kai.”
</div>

<p>
Khalid ya karanta saƙon kuma ya yi murmushi.
</p>

<p>
Ya amsa:
“Fatima, ni ma nayi kewarki. Duk inda nake, ina tunawa da ke.”
</p>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi7">

<h2>Babi na 7 — Amana</h2>

<p>
Soyayyar Khalid da Fatima ta ƙara ƙarfi saboda sun koyi dogara da juna.
</p>

<p>
Sun fahimci cewa amana ita ce ginshiƙin soyayya.
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya ce:
“Ba na neman cikakkiyar mace. Ina neman wadda za ta kasance tare da
ni lokacin farin ciki da lokacin ƙalubale.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta ce:
“Ni kuma bana neman mutum marar kuskure. Ina neman wanda zai
girmama ni, ya saurare ni, ya kuma kasance mai gaskiya.”
</p>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi8">

<h2>Babi na 8 — Gwajin Ƙarshe</h2>

<p>
Wani babban rashin fahimta ya sake tasowa a tsakaninsu. Maganar da
ta fara ƙarama ta kusan zama sanadin rabuwarsu.
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta yi kuka. Khalid ma ya yi nadamar yadda abin ya faru.
</p>

<p>
Amma maimakon su gudu daga matsalar, suka zauna suka tattauna.
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya ce:
“Ba na son mu rasa juna saboda kuskuren fahimta.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta amsa:
“Ni ma bana son haka. Amma dole ne mu koyi sauraron juna.”
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Soyayya ta gaskiya ba ita ce wadda ba ta taɓa samun matsala ba;
ita ce wadda ta san yadda ake shawo kan matsala tare.”
</div>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi9">

<h2>Babi na 9 — Alkawari</h2>

<p>
Bayan duk abin da suka fuskanta, Khalid ya fahimci cewa Fatima ba
ƙaramar soyayya ba ce a rayuwarsa.
</p>

<p>
Ya ce mata:
“Na san rayuwa za ta kawo mana wasu ƙalubale, amma ina son mu
fuskance su tare.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta ce:
“Idan ni da kai muna da gaskiya da haƙuri, za mu iya wuce kowace
jarabawa.”
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya riƙe hannunta ya ce:
“Zan yi iya ƙoƙarina in kiyaye zuciyarki.”
</p>

<p>
Fatima ta murmusa ta ce:
“Ni kuma zan kiyaye taka.”
</p>

</section>


<section class="chapter" id="babi10">

<h2>Babi na 10 — Zuciya Ta</h2>

<p>
Lokaci ya wuce, amma soyayyar Khalid da Fatima ta ƙara zama mai zurfi.
Sun fahimci cewa soyayya ba kawai kalmomi ba ce.
</p>

<p>
Soyayya ita ce kulawa. Ita ce haƙuri. Ita ce amana.
</p>

<p>
Khalid ya kalli Fatima ya ce:
“Fatima, ke ce wadda zuciyata ta zaɓa.”
</p>

<div class="quote">
“Idan soyayya ta gaskiya ce, zuciya ba ta manta wanda ta zaɓa.”
</div>

<p>
Fatima ta murmusa ta ce:
“Khalid, kai ma zuciyata ne.”
</p>

<p>
Kuma haka labarin Zuciya ta ya ci gaba da zama abin tunawa a
zukatan masu karatu.
</p>

<div class="quote">
❤️ “Zuciya ta ta zaɓe ki, Fatima.”
</div>

</section>


